on":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2026-08-20T21:32:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-14T15:08:47Z","closed_at":"2026-10-14T14:33:18Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122672","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122672","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122672.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122672.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nFixes the long-term issue with the inner class and `@tool` script in the editor\r\nThe previous attempt: \r\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116576\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThis PR changes how GDScript inner class navigation works in the editor.\r\nClicking the script icon in the scene tree for a GDScript inner class now opens the owner class (navigation to inner class) instead of an empty class.\r\nClicking the node script property in the inspector opens the owner class (navigation to inner class) instead of an empty class.\r\nSaving the scene now doesn't save GDScript inner class refrences/created nodes in the editor\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\n@tool\r\nextends Node\r\n\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n    var node := TestNode.new()\r\n    add_child(node)\r\n    node.owner = self\r\n\r\n\r\nclass TestNode extends Node: pass\r\n```\r\n```gdscript\r\n@tool\r\nextends Node\r\n\r\n@onready var node: TestNode = %TestNode\r\n\r\nfunc _enter_tree() -> void:\r\n    %TestNode.set_script(TestNode)\r\n\r\n\r\nclass TestNode extends Node: pass\r\n```\r\n\r\nN/AI","closed_by":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122672/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":0,"-1":2,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":3,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122672/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}